<title>USA: Arkansas Best does not reinstate payout.</title>
<headline>Arkansas Best does not reinstate payout.</headline>
<dateline>FORT SMITH, Ark. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Arkansas Best Corp said on Thursday its board had decided not to reinstate the dividend on the company's common stock.</p>
<p>The company suspended its dividend in May, citing a commitment to take steps to return to profitability. The company today reported a $0.49 per share loss for the third quarter.</p>
<p>Prior to the dividend suspension, Arkansas Best had paid $0.01 per share.</p>
<p>Arkansas Best previously said its board would review quarterly whether to reinstate the dividend.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
